+release directory identity, global entry/control pins, bridge/helper/control-I/O/validator digests, dispatcher reply
+public key (`dispatcherReplyPublicKey`), endpoint, and state/fence identities. The approval key must differ from the
+reply key; dispatcher signing-key possession never authorizes another release. Public UDS nonce/reply bytes stay unchanged.
