+record replacement, byte changes (even identical-byte rewrite), anchor loss or replacement invalidate new admission
+permanently for that loaded generation. Bootstrap caches its first selection/failure; no reload/reconnect/retry enrolls
+a new approval. Each worker realm independently verifies the same selected tuple through the existing dispatcher
+registration gates. The coordination policy prohibits publication while any process/realm use lock or unresolved
+fence remains; this source loader is not a cross-realm publication lock or a replacement for those gates.
